                                                "sense_id": "f2269a47-a0b2-34ee-89df-0d5e71a74417",
                                                "text": "The expected announcement is tied to his trip to the Middle East next week, where he’ll visit Saudi Arabia, Qatar and the United Arab Emirates, the officials said."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b7e72ffa-94d5-31fa-a0e8-8bb38d20e1e5",
                                        "entry_id": "9cfc4eaa-75a9-3883-a421-f45ee114eba8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The region between the Near East and the Far East."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
