                                                "sense_id": "b7e72ffa-94d5-31fa-a0e8-8bb38d20e1e5",
                                                "text": "Well, what may happen in the Middle East? I agree there are uncertainties, but when he was condemning the policy of the Government with regard to the Turkish peace, had he thought for a moment of the financial effect of the policy which he advocated?"
                                            }
